    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3*60 (three times sixty) is a pin-ball platformer with limited controls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the ball:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/19483e5a6269fa9b72eff6f34f4d3767.poster.avif?t=1745515426\" width=334 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/19483e5a6269fa9b72eff6f34f4d3767.webm?t=1745515426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/19483e5a6269fa9b72eff6f34f4d3767.mp4?t=1745515426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then drop the ball and collect the three green dots in each level:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/7f08000e241d63695a949db501549c57.poster.avif?t=1745515426\" width=335 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/7f08000e241d63695a949db501549c57.webm?t=1745515426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The catch is, once the ball is dropped it can no-longer be moved left-to-right. However you can jump infinitely:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/311ae2de80fd635138af2b589f349381.poster.avif?t=1745515426\" width=340 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/311ae2de80fd635138af2b589f349381.webm?t=1745515426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/311ae2de80fd635138af2b589f349381.mp4?t=1745515426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to control your movement and reach your goals.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3*60 (three times sixty) is a pin-ball platformer with limited controls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the ball:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/19483e5a6269fa9b72eff6f34f4d3767.poster.avif?t=1745515426\" width=334 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/19483e5a6269fa9b72eff6f34f4d3767.webm?t=1745515426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/19483e5a6269fa9b72eff6f34f4d3767.mp4?t=1745515426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then drop the ball and collect the three green dots in each level:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/7f08000e241d63695a949db501549c57.poster.avif?t=1745515426\" width=335 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/7f08000e241d63695a949db501549c57.webm?t=1745515426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The catch is, once the ball is dropped it can no-longer be moved left-to-right. However you can jump infinitely:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/311ae2de80fd635138af2b589f349381.poster.avif?t=1745515426\" width=340 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/311ae2de80fd635138af2b589f349381.webm?t=1745515426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/311ae2de80fd635138af2b589f349381.mp4?t=1745515426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to control your movement and reach your goals.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "3*60 (three times sixty) is a pin-ball platformer with limited controls. Place and drop the ball, then collect the three green dots in each level. The catch is, once the ball is dropped it can no-longer be moved left-to-right. However you can jump infinitely. Use the walls to bounce to your goal!",
